  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.3.0 — Breaking: AccountUpdate.Positions/Balances and MarginCall.Positions now use PositionChange, BalanceChange and MarginCallPosition, which carry only what the exchange event delivers. The previous full Position/Balance values had to zero the missing fields, and Position.Notional (quantity × mark price) was therefore always zero on account updates — read by a risk check as no exposure. The changed properties arrived in 0.2.0 the day before with no known consumer. Full notes: https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.TradeKit.Abstractions/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
